    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a good start. Could you go into more detail about the specific enzymes involved in that breakdown, like alliinase? Also, I'm looking to describe the \"suddenness\" of the irritation to my students—how does the gas transition from the cell rupture to actually hitting the eyes so quickly? It's almost like it's attacking them out of nowhere.",
